<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse to discuss Kekketi apply on Nov 4.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse to discuss Kekketi apply on Nov 4.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's (BSE) council will discuss at its next regular meeting on November 4 the listing application of mineral water bottler and distributor Kekkuti Asvanyviz Rt, the BSE said.</p>
<p>Kekkuti submitted its application on October 24 for the listing of its shares in the listed B category (formerly called traded category).</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
